s\" content=\"SEO audit,SEO analyzer,on-page SEO,meta tags checker,structured data,Open Graph,technical SEO\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http://localhost:3000\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer — Evidence-backed SEO audits\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Free single-page SEO audit. Check titles, meta descriptions, headings, canonical, robots, Open Graph, Twitter Cards, images, links and structured data — with a documented score, evidence for every finding and a downloadable report.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http://localhost:3000\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer — evidence-backed SEO audits\"/><meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?7f9fdba0b5871059\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer — Evidence-backed SEO audits\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Free single-page SEO audit. Check titles, meta descriptions, headings, canonical, robots, Open Graph, Twitter Cards, images, links and structured data — with a documented score, evidence for every finding and a downloadable report.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"SEO Audit Analyzer — evidence-backed SEO audits\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?7f9fdba0b5871059\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?3eb8bf4e55e452bd\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" sizes=\"any\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon?65733ec3c15c3c62\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"180x180\"/><script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem('theme');if(t==='light'||t==='dark')document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t}catch(e){}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-dvh bg-bg text-ink\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"no-print pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"ambient-blob ambient-1\"></div><div class=\"ambient-blob ambient-2\"></div><div class=\"ambient-blob ambient-3\"></div><div class=\"ambient-blob ambient-4\"></div><div class=\"ambient-dots absolute inset-0\"></div></div><div class=\"overflow-x-clip\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">[{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"SEO Audit Analyzer\",\"description\":\"Free single-page SEO audit. Check titles, meta descriptions, headings, canonical, robots, Open Graph, Twitter Cards, images, links and structured data — with a documented score, evidence for every finding and a downloadable report.\",\"url\":\"http://localhost:3000\",\"applicationCategory\":\"BusinessApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Any\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the score a Google ranking score?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. It is a custom audit score from a published rubric (version 2026.3). It shows how a page performs against those checks and does not predict or guarantee rankings.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does it check JavaScript-rendered content?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The Cloudflare Workers deployment analyzes server-returned HTML and does not execute page JavaScript.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are results live or cached?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Live. Every analysis fetches the page at that moment, and the report shows the exact time it was generated.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need an account?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. There are no accounts. Your current report lives in your browser tab and is cleared when you close it.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does it measure performance?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. A Lighthouse lab test and real-user Core Web Vitals from Google's free APIs run automatically after the audit and feed the overall score. Backlink counts need a paid index and are not included.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I analyse any website?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Any public http or https page you are permitted to test. Private network addresses and non-HTML responses are rejected.\"}}]}]</script><header class=\"site-header no-print sticky top-0 z-30 border-b border-line/70 bg-bg/80 backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-3.5\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2.5 text-ink\" aria-label=\"SEO Audit Analyzer home\" href=\"/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"h-8 w-8 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-[-6deg] group-hover:scale-105\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"audit-mark\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#142c43\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#1c5269\"></stop></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"64\" height=\"64\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"url(#audit-mark)\"></rect><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8bd8e3\" stroke-opacity=\".25\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M15 39h8l6-14 8 20 6-13h6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"32\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#65d6c5\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-[16px] font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-[17px]\">SEO Audit <span class=\"text-accent\">Analyzer</span></span></a><nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"ml-auto hidden items-center gap-1 text-sm sm:flex\"><a class=\"site-nav-link rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#how-it-works\">How it works</a><a class=\"site-nav-link rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#features\">Features</a><a class=\"site-nav-link rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"site-nav-link rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#faq\">FAQ</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark mode\" title=\"Switch to dark mode\" class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface text-muted transition hover:border-accent hover:text-accent active:scale-95\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-[18px] w-[18px]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z\"></path></svg></button></div></div><nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"no-scrollbar flex gap-1 overflow-x-auto border-t border-line/70 px-4 py-2 sm:hidden\"><a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#how-it-works\">How it works</a><a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#features\">Features</a><a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"shrink-0 rounded-md px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted transition hover:bg-panel-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/#faq\">FAQ</a></nav></header><main class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5\"><section class=\"relative pb-6 pt-0 text-left\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"no-print pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-[1] hidden h-[44rem] overflow-hidden sm:block\"><div class=\"hero-aurora\"></div><div class=\"hero-rings\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[28rem]\"><span class=\"hero-chip\" style=\"left:6%;top:18%;animation-delay:0s\"><i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-good\"></i>&lt;title&gt;</span><span class=\"hero-chip\" style=\"right:10%;top:12%;animation-delay:1.2s\"><i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-good\"></i>HTTPS</span><span class=\"hero-chip\" style=\"left:3%;top:58%;animation-delay:2.1s\"><i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-bad\"></i>alt text</span><span class=\"hero-chip\" style=\"right:7%;top:52%;animation-delay:0.6s\"><i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-good\"></i>LCP 2.1s</span><span class=\"hero-chip\" style=\"left:12%;top:86%;animation-delay:1.7s\"><i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-good\"></i>canonical</span><span class=\"hero-chip\" style=\"right:14%;top:88%;animation-delay:2.6s\"><i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-warn\"></i>og:image</span><span class=\"hero-chip\" style=\"left:24%;top:4%;animation-delay:3.1s\"><i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-good\"></i>JSON-LD</span><span class=\"hero-chip\" style=\"right:26%;top:3%;animation-delay:0.9s\"><i class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-good\"></i>robots.txt</span></div></div><div class=\"home-hero\"><div class=\"home-hero-copy\"><p class=\"hero-in hero-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-good\"></span> Your website, under the microscope</p><h1 class=\"hero-in mt-6 max-w-3xl text-5xl leading-[0.98] text-balance sm:text-7xl\">Make every page <span class=\"gradient-text\">search-ready.</span></h1><p class=\"hero-in mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg text-muted text-pretty\">A clear, evidence-first SEO audit that turns technical mysteries into your next best moves.</p><div class=\"hero-in mt-8 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><form aria-busy=\"false\" class=\"relative flex w-full items-center gap-2 border border-line bg-surface transition focus-within:border-accent focus-within:shadow-[0_0_0_4px_var(--glow-strong)] max-w-2xl rounded-2xl p-2 shadow-[var(--shadow-lg)]\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"ml-2 shrink-0 text-muted h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"M20 20l-3.5-3.5\"></path></svg><label for=\"url-hero\" class=\"sr-only\">Page URL</label><input id=\"url-hero\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"url\" autoComplete=\"url\" spellCheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"Enter a page URL, e.g. example.com\" class=\"bare-input min-w-0 flex-1 border-0 bg-transparent outline-none placeholder:text-muted/70 px-1 py-2.5 text-base sm:text-lg\" value=\"\"/><kbd class=\"hidden sm:block\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</kbd><button type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\" class=\"btn btn-primary shrink-0 px-6 py-3 text-base\">Analyze</button></form><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Audits analyze server-returned HTML. JavaScript-rendered content is unavailable in this Workers deployment.</p></div><p class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted\"></p></div></div><p class=\"hero-in hero-proof mt-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> Free, instant and no account needed<span class=\"hero-proof-divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><a href=\"#modules\">Explore 23 audit modules <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></p></div><div class=\"audit-preview\" aria-label=\"Illustrative SEO audit report preview\"><div class=\"preview-glow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"preview-window\"><div class=\"preview-topbar\"><div class=\"preview-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class=\"preview-address\">example.com / audit</span><span class=\"preview-live\"><i></i> LIVE</span></div><div class=\"preview-content\"><div class=\"preview-heading\"><div><p class=\"preview-kicker\">AUDIT OVERVIEW</p><p class=\"preview-domain\">example.com</p></div><span class=\"preview-period\">JUST NOW</span></div><div class=\"preview-score-card\"><div class=\"preview-score-ring\"><span>86</span><small>/100</small></div><div class=\"preview-score-copy\"><strong>Looking good</strong><span>A few wins are waiting for you.</span><div class=\"preview-score-track\"><i></i></div></div></div><div class=\"preview-checks\"><div class=\"preview-check\"><span class=\"preview-check-icon is-good\">✓</span><span>Page titles</span><b>Great</b></div><div class=\"preview-check\"><span class=\"preview-check-icon is-good\">✓</span><span>Page speed</span><b>Fast</b></div><div class=\"preview-check\"><span class=\"preview-check-icon is-warn\">!</span><span>Image alt text</span><b>3 to fix</b></div></div><div class=\"preview-tip\"><span class=\"preview-tip-icon\">✳</span><span><b>Your next best move</b><small>Add descriptive alt text to 3 images</small></span><span class=\"preview-tip-arrow\">↗</span></div></div></div><span class=\"preview-float preview-float-top\"><i>↗</i> Visibility, made clear</span><span class=\"preview-float preview-float-bottom\"><i>✦</i> Built on real evidence</span></div></div></section><div class=\"marquee mt-16\" aria-label=\"Checks included in every audit\"><div class=\"marquee-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Title tag</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Meta description</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Headings</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Canonical</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Open Graph</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Structured data</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Alt text</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Core Web Vitals</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Broken links</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Sitemap</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>robots.txt</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Security headers</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>TLS</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Accessibility</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>JS rendering</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Keywords</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Traffic rank</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Title tag</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Meta description</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Headings</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Canonical</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Open Graph</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Structured data</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Alt text</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Core Web Vitals</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Broken links</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Sitemap</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>robots.txt</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Security headers</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>TLS</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Accessibility</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>JS rendering</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Keywords</span><span class=\"marquee-item\"><b>✦</b>Traffic rank</span></div></div><section class=\"py-8\" aria-label=\"At a glance\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div data-reveal=\"true\" style=\"--d:0ms\" class=\"card card-hover spot p-5\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-semibold text-accent\"><span class=\"opacity-0\">0</span></div><div class=\"mt-1 font-medium\">report pages</div><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted\">One page per module, plus performance, links, traffic and security.</p></div><div data-reveal=\"true\" style=\"--d:70ms\" class=\"card card-hover spot p-5\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-semibold text-accent\"><span class=\"opacity-0\">0</span></div><div class=\"mt-1 font-medium\">point rubric</div><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted\">Published weights. Pass earns full weight, warning half, fail zero.</p></div><div data-reveal=\"true\" style=\"--d:140ms\" class=\"card card-hover spot p-5\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-semibold text-accent\"><span class=\"opacity-0\">0</span></div><div class=\"mt-1 font-medium\">download formats</div><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted\">PDF, HTML, Markdown, CSV and JSON.</p></div><div data-reveal=\"true\" style=\"--d:210ms\" class=\"card card-hover spot p-5\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-semibold text-accent\"><span class=\"opacity-0\">0</span></div><div class=\"mt-1 font-medium\">keys or sign-ups</div><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted\">Everything runs on free, public data. No account needed.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"hero-demo-section\" aria-label=\"Interactive example audit\"><div class=\"hero-demo-heading\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow text-accent\">A closer look</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Watch your audit take shape.</h2></div><p class=\"max-w-md text-muted\">Every score has a reason. Follow a sample audit as it checks a page and builds a report.</p></div><figure aria-label=\"Animated example of an audit\" class=\"hero-frame hero-in mx-auto mt-14 w-full max-w-5xl text-left\"><div class=\"hero-frame-inner card relative overflow-hidden shadow-[var(--shadow-lg)]\"><div class=\"scan-beam\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-b border-line bg-panel-2/60 px-4 py-3\"><ol class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors bg-accent text-on-accent\"><span class=\"font-mono\">1</span>Fetch</span><span class=\"h-px w-3 bg-line\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors bg-surface text-muted\"><span class=\"font-mono\">2</span>Inspect</span><span class=\"h-px w-3 bg-line\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors bg-surface text-muted\"><span class=\"font-mono\">3</span>Score</span><span class=\"h-px w-3 bg-line\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors bg-surface text-muted\"><span class=\"font-mono\">4</span>Fix</span></li></ol><p class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate font-mono text-xs text-muted\">Fetching the page and reading its HTML…</p><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted\">Sample · acme.com</span></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr]\"><div class=\"border-b border-line p-5 md:border-b-0 md:border-r\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Score as each check is inspected</p><p class=\"mt-1 flex items-baseline gap-2\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-bold tabular-nums text-bad\">0</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">/ 100 · <!-- -->0<!-- --> of <!-- -->8<!-- --> checks</span></p></div><div class=\"hidden gap-3 text-[11px] text-muted sm:flex\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-good\"></span>Pass</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-warn\"></span>Warning</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-bad\"></span>Fail</span></div></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 250\" class=\"mt-2 h-auto w-full\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Running audit score as checks are inspected\"><g><line x1=\"48\" x2=\"580\" y1=\"206\" y2=\"206\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-dasharray=\"0\"></line><text x=\"42\" y=\"209.5\" text-anchor=\"end\