ser tab and is cleared when you close it.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does it measure performance?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. A Lighthouse lab test and real-user Core Web Vitals from Google's free APIs run automatically after the audit and feed the overall score. Backlink counts need a paid index and are not included.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I analyse any website?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Any public http or https page you are permitted to test. Private network addresses and non-HTML responses are rejected.\"}}]}]0:{\"P\":null,\"b\":\"7QrUFpkHCu0gmrphTjyBE\",\"p\":\"\",\"c\":[\"\",\"\"],\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],[\"\",[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/d984b921b3e2a4bc.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"className\":\"__variable_d8ebd1 __variable_4dc837\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"head\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"try{var t=localStorage.getItem('theme');if(t==='light'||t==='dark')document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t}catch(e){}\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-dvh bg-bg text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"no-print pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ambient-blob ambient-1\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ambient-blob ambient-2\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ambient-blob ambient-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ambient-blob ambient-4\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ambient-dots absolute inset-0\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"chi